<div><b>get(key: string): string | null</b></div>
</li><ul><li>
<div>Retrieves the value associated with a given key.</div>
</li><li>
<div>If the key is not found, return <code spellcheck=3D"false">null</code>=
.</div>
</li><li>
<div>Marks the accessed key as <b>most recently used</b>.</div>
